  all-traces
  "∀ RAND AUTN #i.
    (Out_Src( RAND, AUTN ) @ #i) ⇒
    (∃ #j. (Src( RAND, AUTN ) @ #j) ∧ (#j < #i))"
/*
guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
